        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "213. The various programs covered above include those sponsored by educational institutions; government agencies, hospital, union, professional associations. It is agreed that the above set forth activities shall be job related or those to which the employee can expect to transfer or be promoted in the usual course of eligibility. Educational leave shall be applicable only for actual attendance in the course, seminar, class or symposium and shall not apply for preparatory time incidental to those courses, seminars, classes, or symposia.",
